		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Towering, predatory pitcher plant. Sometimes used for body disposal or planted to guard a place or thing.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 10, <strong>HP</strong> 27, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 tentacle +3 (1d8 + grab) or digest, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> -4, <strong>W</strong> -3, <strong>Ch</strong> -4, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Digest</strong>. Swallow grabbed target. Total darkness inside and 2d10 damage per round. Flower regurgitates all swallowed if dealt at least 10 damage in one round to the inside of its gullet.</p><p></p><p><strong>Grab</strong>. STR 15+ or held. STR 15+ on turn to break free.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
